flowchart LR
    Viewer((Viewer browser))
    OIDC["Consumer OIDC provider<br/>User and group assignment"]

    subgraph AWS["AWS Cloud"]
        Route53["Amazon Route 53"]
        ACM["AWS Certificate Manager<br/>DNS-validated certificate"]
        WAF["AWS WAF<br/>Associated WebACL with AWS managed rules"]
        Alarms["Amazon CloudWatch<br/>Authentication and target alarms"]
        CloudWatchLogs["Amazon CloudWatch Logs<br/>AWS WAF and Amazon VPC Flow Logs"]
        Logs["Amazon S3<br/>Load balancer and site access logs"]

        subgraph VPC["Amazon VPC"]
            ALB["Application Load Balancer<br/>HTTP redirect and OIDC authentication"]
            Endpoint["Amazon S3 interface endpoint<br/>AWS PrivateLink network interfaces"]
        end

        Site["Amazon S3<br/>Private versioned REST bucket"]
    end

    Viewer -->|1a| ALB
    Viewer -->|1b| ALB
    WAF -.->|2| ALB
    ALB <-->|3| OIDC
    Route53 -.->|4a| ALB
    ACM -.->|4b| ALB
    ALB -->|5a| Endpoint
    ALB -.->|5b| Endpoint
    Endpoint -->|6| Site
    ALB -.->|7a| Alarms
    ALB -.->|7b| Logs
    WAF -.->|7c| CloudWatchLogs
    Site -.->|7d| Logs
    VPC -.->|7e| CloudWatchLogs

    %% Flow key is rendered as an accessible table below the Sphinx figure.
    %% 1a: Approved viewer HTTP; listener redirects 301 to HTTPS
    %% 1b: Approved viewer HTTPS to the Application Load Balancer
    %% 2: Associated AWS WAF WebACL inspects load balancer requests
    %% 3: OIDC authorization, callback, tokens, and user information
    %% 4a: Amazon Route 53 public alias
    %% 4b: AWS Certificate Manager regional TLS certificate
    %% 5a: Post-OIDC HTTPS content request to endpoint network interfaces
    %% 5b: HTTP reachability health check; responses 200-499 are healthy
    %% 6: AWS PrivateLink REST GetObject from the private Amazon S3 bucket
    %% 7a: Authentication and target metrics and alarms
    %% 7b: Load balancer access logs
    %% 7c: Redacted AWS WAF request logs
    %% 7d: Site-bucket server access logs
    %% 7e: Amazon VPC Flow Logs for all traffic
